WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.516
Below the crust is the mantle, most
of the Earth's volume.

00:00:03.966 --> 00:00:08.422
It is solid rock, yet it creeps, a
few centimetres a year, and carries

00:00:08.422 --> 00:00:09.632
the plates with it.

00:00:10.082 --> 00:00:16.374
At 670 km down, the pressure squeezes
its minerals into denser forms.

00:00:16.824 --> 00:00:18.647
That is the top of the lower mantle.
